(127, 1, 'EMBROIDED SCALLOPED NAPKINS (SET OF 2) - RED', '<p>Thoughtfully crafted in natural fibers, this napkin set brings a quiet sense of warmth and refinement to your table. The solid hue is elevated by a delicately scalloped edge, adding a soft, graceful accent to everyday dining and special gatherings alike.<br />\n<br />\nVersatile and timeless, these napkins pair effortlessly with a variety of table settings—layer them with ceramics, glassware, or wood for a look that feels both relaxed and considered. The natural texture of linen enhances their appeal, softening beautifully with every wash.<br />\n<br />\nMade in small batches by master artisans, each piece reflects careful craftsmanship and enduring quality.<br />\n<br />\nPacked as a set of 2.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 18&quot; x 18&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Linen<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle with like colors. Do not bleach. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry low. Warm iron as needed.</p>', 'ready', 'EMBROIDED SCALLOPED NAPKINS (SET OF 2) - RED', 'Thoughtfully crafted in natural fibers, this napkin set brings a quiet sense of warmth and refinement to your table. The solid hue is elevated by a delicately scalloped edge, adding a soft, graceful accent to everyday dining and special gatherings alike.\n', 'Dinner & Cloth Napkin'),
(128, 1, 'GREETING CARD SET - HOLIDAY EDIT BLUE VINTAGE VINES', '<p>Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and hand-screen printing.<br />\n<br />\nEach pack contains 8 greeting cards with envelopes.<br />\n<br />\nTime to write a note to someone you care for, a friend, a family member, or even yourself. There’s something intimate and profound about this timeless form of expression.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 4&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'GREETING CARD SET - HOLIDAY EDIT BLUE VINTAGE VINES', 'Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and hand-screen printing.\n\nEach pack con', 'Everyday Greeting Card'),
(129, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED KEEPSAKE PHOTO FRAME -MUSTARD VANA', '<p>This Artisanal, Keepsake Picture Frames are made by Master Artisans who have been created vintage style boxes and artisanal products for generations in Jaipur. The Paper design is Hand Block. Produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home filled with Nostalgic &amp; Slow Living Objects.  <br />\n<br />\nSize : Frame Size - 6&quot; x 7.5&quot; / Fits Photo Size - 6&quot; x 4&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial : 100% Recycled Cotton Paper inside &amp; Cotton Fabric Covered Outside<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED KEEPSAKE PHOTO FRAME -MUSTARD VANA', 'This Artisanal, Keepsake Picture Frames are made by Master Artisans who have been created vintage style boxes and artisanal products for generations in Jaipur. The Paper design is Hand Block. Produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home fill', 'Picture Frame'),
(130, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - GREEN ROBIN PEONY', '<p>Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat studio in Jaipur, reflecting artistry, patience, and precision.<br />\n<br />\nMade from soft cotton voile with pure cotton filling, this reversible quilt offers lightweight comfort with intricate hand-stitched detailing on both sides. Subtle variations make every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to add warmth and timeless charm to your space, it celebrates slow, mindful craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nQueen – 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\nTwin and King sizes available upon request<br />\n<br />\nMaterial:<br />\nTop Fabric: 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nFilling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions:<br />\nDry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - GREEN ROBIN PEONY', 'Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat st', 'Quilt'),
(131, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - MINT VANA', '<p>Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat studio in Jaipur, reflecting artistry, patience, and precision.<br />\n<br />\nMade from soft cotton voile with pure cotton filling, this reversible quilt offers lightweight comfort with intricate hand-stitched detailing on both sides. Subtle variations make every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to add warmth and timeless charm to your space, it celebrates slow, mindful craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nQueen – 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\nTwin and King sizes available upon request<br />\n<br />\nMaterial:<br />\nTop Fabric: 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nFilling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions:<br />\nDry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready,bestseller,featured', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - MINT VANA', 'Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat st', 'Quilt'),
