(159, 1, 'HAND MARBLED POLDINA LAMPSHADE COVER - BLUE YELLOW MOUNTAIN', '<p>Hand Marbled Lampshade Covers, designed to fit the Poldina Pro LED Table Lamp. A simple way to add handcrafted beauty to everyday functional products. <br />\n<br />\nMade from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, these covers are hand-marbled by Master Artisans in Jaipur and produced in small batches. Designed to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow-living objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 3.75&quot;H x 4.5&quot;W x 3.5&quot;Ø<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED POLDINA LAMPSHADE COVER - BLUE YELLOW MOUNTAIN', 'Hand Marbled Lampshade Covers, designed to fit the Poldina Pro LED Table Lamp. A simple way to add handcrafted beauty to everyday functional products. \n\nMade from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, these covers are hand-marbled by Master Artisans in Jai', 'Lamp Shade');
