(166, 1, 'HAND MARBLED ROUND DESK TRAY SET - CELADON GREEN MOUNTAIN', '<p>Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Paper Tray Sets are made by Master Artisans who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations in Jaipur. The paper design is hand-marbled and produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home filled with Artisanal Slow Living Objects.<br />\n<br />\n Set of Nested Small and Large Trays <br />\n<br />\nSize: Large - 4.5&quot; x 9&quot; x 1&quot;<br />\nSmall - 4&quot; X 4&quot; X 0.6&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready,new', 'HAND MARBLED ROUND DESK TRAY SET - CELADON GREEN MOUNTAIN', 'Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.\n\nR', 'Desk Tray'),
