(184, 1, 'MARBLED KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', '<p>A beautifully handcrafted jewellery box designed to keep your treasured pieces organized and protected. Wrapped in 100% cotton casement fabric with hand-marbled patterns, each box features unique flowing designs, making every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nThe removable tray includes dedicated compartments for rings, earrings, and other small accessories, while the spacious lower compartment provides extra storage for larger jewellery and keepsakes. Handcrafted in small batches, it blends timeless craftsmanship with everyday functionality.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\n• Size: 9.5&quot; × 7&quot; × 3.5&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton Casement<br />\n• Made in India</p>', 'ready,new', 'MARBLED KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', 'A beautifully handcrafted jewellery box designed to keep your treasured pieces organized and protected. Wrapped in 100% cotton casement fabric with hand-marbled patterns, each box features unique flowing designs, making every piece truly one of a kind.\n\nT', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
