(187, 1, 'MARBLED SCALLOPED TRAY SET - BURGUNDY GOLD PEACOCK FEATHER', '<p>Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted by master artisans using recycled cotton handmade paper and traditional cartonnage techniques, these tray sets feature unique hand-marbled designs produced in small batches. Thoughtfully made to bring artisanal charm and slow-living elegance to your home.<br />\n<br />\n Set of Nested Small and Large Trays <br />\n<br />\nSize : Large - 12&quot; x 9.5&quot; x 1.5&quot;<br />\nSmall - 5.5&quot; X 6.75&quot; X 1.5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'MARBLED SCALLOPED TRAY SET - BURGUNDY GOLD PEACOCK FEATHER', 'Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.\n\nC', 'Decorative Tray'),
