(190, 1, 'MARBLED SQUARE TISSUE BOX - RED MOUNTAIN', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nThe surface showcases distinctive hand-marbled designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5&quot; x 5&quot; x 5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'MARBLED SQUARE TISSUE BOX - RED MOUNTAIN', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n', 'Tissue Box'),
