(192, 1, 'NATURAL DYED COTTON RIBBONS - MADDER LILAC (Pack of 6) - Lilac', '<p>Set of 6 Madder Lilac Dyed Ribbons<br />\n<br />\nAdd a soft, nature-inspired touch to your gifts and spaces with our madder lilac-dyed ribbons. Crafted from 100% cotton and naturally dyed in madder lilac tones, each ribbon carries a gentle, organic hue that feels both subtle and calming.<br />\n<br />\nPacked as a set of six, these ribbons are perfect for gift wrapping, decorating, or adding a thoughtful detail to special occasions.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade with care by the artisans of Craft Boat.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 200 cm x 3 cm<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton, Naturally Dyed<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'NATURAL DYED COTTON RIBBONS - MADDER LILAC (Pack of 6) - Lilac', 'Set of 6 Madder Lilac Dyed Ribbons\n\nAdd a soft, nature-inspired touch to your gifts and spaces with our madder lilac-dyed ribbons. Crafted from 100% cotton and naturally dyed in madder lilac tones, each ribbon carries a gentle, organic hue that feels both', 'Ribbon - Gift Wrapping'),
(193, 1, 'SCREEN PRINTED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - VINTAGE VINES', '<p>Pen all your creative ideas and indulge in self reflection with<br />\nour handbound journal. Suitable for dry artistic media including pastels, ink, pencil, charcoal, and pen.<br />\n<br />\nMade using 100% Cotton Recycled Handmade Paper, with a Block Printed<br />\ncover. <br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 8&quot; | 56 Pages | 150gsm<br />\n<br />\nMaterial : 100% Recycled Cotton Paper</p>', 'ready', 'SCREEN PRINTED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - VINTAGE VINES', 'Pen all your creative ideas and indulge in self reflection with\nour handbound journal. Suitable for dry artistic media including pastels, ink, pencil, charcoal, and pen.\n\nMade using 100% Cotton Recycled Handmade Paper, with a Block Printed\ncover. \n\nSize: ', 'Notebook'),
