(258, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - MUSTARD MEHER', '<p>This quilted jewellery pouch is a soft, compact essential designed to keep your valuables safe and organized. Crafted from 100% cotton and adorned with delicate hand block prints, its Quilted structure helps protect jewellery from scratches and damage.<br />\n<br />\nFeaturing an easy drawstring closure, it’s perfect for storing rings, earrings, bracelets, or small keepsakes. Lightweight and travel-friendly, it fits effortlessly into your handbag or luggage.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade in small batches by skilled artisans in Jaipur, each piece reflects traditional craftsmanship, with subtle variations that make every pouch truly unique—blending beauty with everyday functionality.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 4.5&quot; x 4.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\n made in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - MUSTARD MEHER', 'This quilted jewellery pouch is a soft, compact essential designed to keep your valuables safe and organized. Crafted from 100% cotton and adorned with delicate hand block prints, its Quilted structure helps protect jewellery from scratches and damage.\n\nF', 'Pouch - Women\'s'),
