(272, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED COTTON TOTE BAG - ORANGE CLUB STRIPE', '<p>A spacious everyday tote designed for effortless organization and versatility. Hand block printed on durable 100% cotton canvas, it features a roomy interior with practical pockets to keep your essentials organized. Perfect for shopping, work, travel, or everyday errands.<br />\n<br />\nHandcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans and finished with sturdy cotton webbing handles, each bag showcases the beauty of traditional craftsmanship with subtle variations that make every piece unique.<br />\n<br />\n• Size: 11&quot;H × 12.5&quot;W × 7&quot;D | 7&quot; Handle Drop<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton Canvas<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions: Hand wash with like colors. Do not soak. Line dry in shade. Do not iron. Do not dry clean.</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED COTTON TOTE BAG - ORANGE CLUB STRIPE', 'A spacious everyday tote designed for effortless organization and versatility. Hand block printed on durable 100% cotton canvas, it features a roomy interior with practical pockets to keep your essentials organized. Perfect for shopping, work, travel, or ', 'Tote Bag - Women\'s'),
(273, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED DESK TRAY SET - BLUE FLORAL STRIPE', '<p>Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Paper Tray Sets are made by Master Artisans who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations in Jaipur. The paper design is block printed and produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home filled with Artisanal Slow Living Objects.<br />\n<br />\n Set of Nested Small and Large Trays <br />\n<br />\nSize: 4.5&quot; x 9&quot; x 1&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED DESK TRAY SET - BLUE FLORAL STRIPE', 'Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.\n\nR', 'Desk Tray'),
(274, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED EMBROIDED SCALLOPED NAPKIN (SET 2)- ROSE BROWN', '<p>Thoughtfully crafted in natural fibers, this set of block-printed table napkins brings warmth and character to your table. The delicate scalloped edge adds a refined touch, while the prints introduce a subtle pop of colour.<br />\n<br />\nVersatile and timeless, they are perfect for both everyday meals and special gatherings. The natural linen texture softens beautifully with each wash, enhancing its charm over time.<br />\n<br />\nMade in small batches by master artisans, each piece reflects skilled craftsmanship and traditional techniques.<br />\n<br />\nPacked as a set of 2.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 18&quot; x 18&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Linen<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle with like colors. Do not bleach. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry low. Warm iron as needed.</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED EMBROIDED SCALLOPED NAPKIN (SET 2)- ROSE BROWN', 'Thoughtfully crafted in natural fibers, this set of block-printed table napkins brings warmth and character to your table. The delicate scalloped edge adds a refined touch, while the prints introduce a subtle pop of colour.\n\nVersatile and timeless, they a', 'Dinner & Cloth Napkin'),
