(278, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - OCHRE FLORAL STRIPE', '<p>Pen all your creative ideas and indulge in self reflection with<br />\nour handbound journal. Suitable for dry artistic media including pastels, ink, pencil, charcoal, and pen.<br />\n<br />\nMade using 100% Cotton Recycled Handmade Paper, with a Hand Block Printed<br />\ncover. <br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 8&quot; | 56 Pages | 150gsm<br />\n<br />\nMaterial : 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - OCHRE FLORAL STRIPE', 'Pen all your creative ideas and indulge in self reflection with\nour handbound journal. Suitable for dry artistic media including pastels, ink, pencil, charcoal, and pen.\n\nMade using 100% Cotton Recycled Handmade Paper, with a Hand Block Printed\ncover. \n\nS', 'Journal/Diary'),
