(316, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED JEWELLERY POUCH - CELADON GREEN DOT & GRID', '<p>This quilted jewelry pouch is a soft, compact essential designed to keep your valuables safe and organized. Crafted from 100% cotton and adorned with delicate hand block prints, its quilted structure helps protect jewelry from scratches and damage.<br />\n<br />\nFeaturing an easy drawstring closure, it’s perfect for storing rings, earrings, bracelets, or small keepsakes. Lightweight and travel-friendly, it fits effortlessly into your handbag or luggage.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade in small batches by skilled artisans in Jaipur, each piece reflects traditional craftsmanship, with subtle variations that make every pouch truly unique—blending beauty with everyday functionality.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 4.5&quot; x 4.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED JEWELLERY POUCH - CELADON GREEN DOT & GRID', 'This quilted jewelry pouch is a soft, compact essential designed to keep your valuables safe and organized. Crafted from 100% cotton and adorned with delicate hand block prints, its quilted structure helps protect jewelry from scratches and damage.\n\nFeatu', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(317, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED JUBAKO BOX - CELADON GREEN BLOOMING TRELLIS', '<p>This product is made with a block-printed cotton-covered hardboard sheet. Hand-block printed on fabric and made by the artisans of Craft Boat.<br />\n<br />\nThe beautiful prints are inspired by the hand-drawn florals of Chinoiserie. Each design is a timeless impression and involves seamless hard work and compassion towards making the product so delicate.<br />\n<br />\nSuitable for: Dressing table, the table next to your front door, bedside table, anywhere that requires a little organizing<br />\n<br />\nOur recommendation: Best for keeping jewelry and other accessories.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 4&quot; x 4&quot; x 8&quot; <br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready,new', 'BLOCK PRINTED JUBAKO BOX - CELADON GREEN BLOOMING TRELLIS', 'This product is made with a block-printed cotton-covered hardboard sheet. Hand-block printed on fabric and made by the artisans of Craft Boat.\n\nThe beautiful prints are inspired by the hand-drawn florals of Chinoiserie. Each design is a timeless impressio', 'Decorative Box'),
