(350, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED QUILTED POUCH - SKY MEHER - Large', '<p>Hand block printed and quilted by master artisans in Jaipur, India, each pouch is crafted in soft 100% cotton and produced in small batches. Featuring a delicate floral pattern with fine detailing, it reflects the charm of traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nThe padded structure offers gentle protection, while the zip closure keeps your belongings secure. Lightweight and easy to carry, it’s a perfect blend of functionality and artisanal elegance.<br />\n<br />\nSubtle variations in print and stitching make every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nLarge – 9.5&quot; x 6.5&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\nSmall – 7.5&quot; x 4.5&quot; x 2&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial:<br />\n100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\n Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED QUILTED POUCH - SKY MEHER - Large', 'Hand block printed and quilted by master artisans in Jaipur, India, each pouch is crafted in soft 100% cotton and produced in small batches. Featuring a delicate floral pattern with fine detailing, it reflects the charm of traditional craftsmanship.\n\nThe ', 'Pouch - Women\'s'),
