(372, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - BLUE CHERRY BLOSSOM', '<p>Inspired by the charm of country living, this ruffled cushion cover adds a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring hand block printed patterns, each piece is unique and reflects the beauty of traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with delicate ruffled edges, it brings a cozy, vintage feel—perfect for sofas, beds, or accent chairs. Made from premium European linen and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 12&quot; x 16&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% European Linen<br />\nClosure: Concealed zipper for a neat, seamless finish<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle with like colors. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry on a low setting. Iron on the reverse side suggested.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - BLUE CHERRY BLOSSOM', 'Inspired by the charm of country living, this ruffled cushion cover adds a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring hand block printed patterns, each piece is unique and reflects the beauty of traditional craftsmanship.\n\nFinished with delicate ruffled', 'Throw Pillow Cover'),
