(389, 1, 'BLOCK PRINTED SCALLOPED PEN POT - GARNET RED FLORAL STRIPE', '<p>Designed to sit neatly on desks and shelves, this paper pen pot is ideal for storing pens, pencils, brushes, and other small stationery essentials. Compact yet functional, it adds an artisanal touch to workspaces, bedside tables, or study corners.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled cotton handmade paper pen pots are made by master artisans who have been creating vintage-style boxes and artisanal products for generations in Jaipur. The paper design is hand block printed and produced in small batches only. Designed to inspire a home filled with artisanal slow living objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 3.25&quot; x 3.25&quot; x 4.5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK PRINTED SCALLOPED PEN POT - GARNET RED FLORAL STRIPE', 'Designed to sit neatly on desks and shelves, this paper pen pot is ideal for storing pens, pencils, brushes, and other small stationery essentials. Compact yet functional, it adds an artisanal touch to workspaces, bedside tables, or study corners.\n\nRecycl', 'Pen & Pencil Holder'),
