(481, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED LINEN NAPKIN (SET OF 2) - BLUE BUTI FLOWER', '<p>Inspired by the quiet charm of country living, these hand block printed table napkins bring warmth and artisanal beauty to your dining experience. Each piece is thoughtfully crafted in 100% European linen, of 40&#039;s Thread count. showcasing the subtle elegance and natural texture of premium fabric.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade in small batches by skilled artisans, every napkin carries the unique character of traditional block printing.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for everyday dining or special gatherings, this Set of 2 adds a timeless, understated sophistication to your table setting.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 18&quot; x 18&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Linen<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions:<br />\nMachine wash cold on a gentle cycle with like colors. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry on low. Iron on reverse side for best results.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED LINEN NAPKIN (SET OF 2) - BLUE BUTI FLOWER', 'Inspired by the quiet charm of country living, these hand block printed table napkins bring warmth and artisanal beauty to your dining experience. Each piece is thoughtfully crafted in 100% European linen, of 40\'s Thread count. showcasing the subtle elega', 'Dinner & Cloth Napkin'),
