(567, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED SCALLOPED COLLAPSIBLE BASKET - SKY MEHER', '<p>Designed to sit beautifully in the corners of your home, this paper basket is ideal for dry waste or to store rolls of paper, fabric, and toys, among other things.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Paper Baskets are made by Master Artisans who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations in Jaipur. The paper design is block printed and produced in Small Batches only. Designed to inspire a home filled with Artisanal Slow Living Objects.<br />\n<br />\n• Size: 9.5&quot; x 9.5&quot; x 12&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n• Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED SCALLOPED COLLAPSIBLE BASKET - SKY MEHER', 'Designed to sit beautifully in the corners of your home, this paper basket is ideal for dry waste or to store rolls of paper, fabric, and toys, among other things.\n\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Paper Baskets are made by Master Artisans who have been creating ', 'Basket'),
(568, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED SQAURE TISSUE BOX - MINT VANA', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nEach box features distinctive block-printed designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5&quot; x 5&quot; x 5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED SQAURE TISSUE BOX - MINT VANA', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n', 'Tissue Box'),
(569, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED SQUARE CUSHION COVE - GARNET RED FLORAL STRIPE', '<p>Elevate your living space with this beautifully handcrafted block printed cushion cover, designed to bring warmth, character, and timeless charm into your home. Each piece showcases intricate hand-block printed patterns, where slight variations celebrate the authenticity and beauty of human touch.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted in small batches by skilled artisans, this cushion cover reflects generations of traditional craftsmanship, blending heritage techniques with a contemporary aesthetic—perfect for styling your sofa, bed, or favorite cozy corner.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\n• Size: 20&quot; x 20&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton<br />\n• Closure: Concealed YKK zipper for a clean, refined finish<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Machine wash on cold gentle cycle with like colors. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry low. Iron on the reverse side suggested.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED SQUARE CUSHION COVE - GARNET RED FLORAL STRIPE', 'Elevate your living space with this beautifully handcrafted block printed cushion cover, designed to bring warmth, character, and timeless charm into your home. Each piece showcases intricate hand-block printed patterns, where slight variations celebrate ', 'Throw Pillow Cover'),
