(593, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED TISSUE BOX - CELADON GREEN CHECKER BOARD', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nEach box features distinctive block-printed designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5&quot; x 5&quot; x 5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED TISSUE BOX - CELADON GREEN CHECKER BOARD', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n\nEach bo', 'Tissue Box'),
(594, 1, 'BLOCK-PRINTED WALL PICTURE FRAME - BLUE SPRING BLOOM', '<p>A simple and thoughtful frame for displaying your favorite memories. Designed for the wall, it helps showcase your cherished moments with ease and warmth.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Wall Frames are crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations. The surface features hand block printed designs, produced in small batches, making each frame unique and full of character.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow living objects, this frame blends timeless craftsmanship with everyday functionality.<br />\n<br />\nSize: Frame Size – 10&quot; x 12&quot; / Photo Size – 5&quot; x 7&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCK-PRINTED WALL PICTURE FRAME - BLUE SPRING BLOOM', 'A simple and thoughtful frame for displaying your favorite memories. Designed for the wall, it helps showcase your cherished moments with ease and warmth.\n\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Wall Frames are crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, who have been creati', 'Picture Frame');
