(599, 1, 'BLOCKPRINTED HEXAGON BASKET - CELADON GREEN FLORAL STRIPE', '<p>Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any space.<br />\n<br />\nThese recycled cotton, handmade paper baskets are crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations. The paper design features unique block printing and is produced in small batches. Celebrating the beauty of mindful, slow living.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 9.5&quot; x 9.5&quot; x 10.5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'BLOCKPRINTED HEXAGON BASKET - CELADON GREEN FLORAL STRIPE', 'Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any sp', 'Basket'),
