(603, 1, 'CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS STAR (S) - CELADON GREEN CHECK', '<p>Add a handcrafted touch to your holiday décor with our Christmas Star Ornament. Made from 100% Cotton and hand block printed in a classic checkered pattern, this soft star ornament features decorative fabric ties for easy hanging on Christmas trees, wreaths, garlands, or gift packages.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade in small batches, each ornament brings a simple yet festive charm to your seasonal décor.<br />\n<br />\n• Size: 4.5&quot; × 4.5&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton<br />\n• Technique: Hand Block Printed<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS STAR (S) - CELADON GREEN CHECK', 'Add a handcrafted touch to your holiday décor with our Christmas Star Ornament. Made from 100% Cotton and hand block printed in a classic checkered pattern, this soft star ornament features decorative fabric ties for easy hanging on Christmas trees, wreat', 'Ornament'),
