(608, 1, 'CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS STAR - HARBOR BLUE CHECK', '<p>Bring festive charm to holiday interiors with this handcrafted Christmas star ornament in a classic Harbor Blue check pattern. Made from 100% cotton and hand block printed, it features contrasting piping and decorative fabric ties for a refined, handcrafted finish. Its star-shaped design adds a thoughtful, artisanal touch to Christmas décor.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for decorating Christmas trees, wreaths, doors, or festive displays, it brings warmth and character to seasonal celebrations. Made in small batches, each ornament celebrates traditional craftsmanship and timeless holiday traditions.<br />\n<br />\nProduct Details<br />\n<br />\nSize: 9.5&quot; × 9.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\nTechnique: Hand Block Printed<br />\nDesign: Harbor Blue Check<br />\nFinish: Contrasting Piping with Decorative Fabric Ties<br />\nShape: Star<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS STAR - HARBOR BLUE CHECK', 'Bring festive charm to holiday interiors with this handcrafted Christmas star ornament in a classic Harbor Blue check pattern. Made from 100% cotton and hand block printed, it features contrasting piping and decorative fabric ties for a refined, handcraft', 'Ornament'),
(609, 1, 'CHRISTMAS STOCKING PIPING - GARNET RED CHECK', '<p>Bring festive charm to holiday interiors with this handcrafted Christmas stocking featuring a timeless check pattern and a clean cuff. Made from 100% cotton and hand block printed, it is finished with decorative drawstring ties and a hanging loop for a classic festive look.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for filling with holiday treats, small gifts, and keepsakes, it adds a thoughtful, artisanal touch to mantels, staircases, or Christmas tree displays. Made in small batches, each stocking celebrates the beauty of handcrafted traditions and seasonal décor.<br />\n<br />\nProduct Details<br />\n<br />\nSize: 16&quot; × 5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\nTechnique: Hand Block Printed<br />\nDesign: Check Pattern<br />\nFinish: Clean Cuff with Decorative Drawstring Ties<br />\nHanging Loop for Easy Display<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'CHRISTMAS STOCKING PIPING - GARNET RED CHECK', 'Bring festive charm to holiday interiors with this handcrafted Christmas stocking featuring a timeless check pattern and a clean cuff. Made from 100% cotton and hand block printed, it is finished with decorative drawstring ties and a hanging loop for a cl', 'Holiday Stocking'),
