(621, 1, 'Curvy Candle Stand - Clear', '<p>Elevate your ambiance with the beauty of our borosilicate candle stand. The durable &amp; heat resistance glass ensures stability &amp; allows essence of candle light all over. <br />\n<br />\nDimensions - 5&quot;(H) x 3.8&quot;(bottom ∅) 1&quot;(top ∅)&quot;</p>', 'ready', 'Curvy Candle Stand - Clear', 'Elevate your ambiance with the beauty of our borosilicate candle stand. The durable & heat resistance glass ensures stability & allows essence of candle light all over. \n\nDimensions - 5\"(H) x 3.8\"(bottom ∅) 1\"(top ∅)\"', 'Candle Holder'),
