(625, 1, 'FLOWER PETAL OVAL DESK TRAY - CELADON GREEN FIRE WHIRL', '<p>Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.<br />\n<br />\nHandcrafted by master artisans in Jaipur, this recycled cotton handmade paper tray features a hand-marbled paper design, making each piece one of a kind. Produced in small batches, it celebrates mindful craftsmanship and the beauty of slow living.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 7.5&quot; x 5.25&quot; x 1.6&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Handmade Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'FLOWER PETAL OVAL DESK TRAY - CELADON GREEN FIRE WHIRL', 'Thoughtfully designed to keep your everyday essentials in place, this compact tray is perfect for organizing pencils, notes, keys, or jewelry. Whether styled on a desk, bedside, or entryway, it adds both function and understated elegance to your space.\n\nH', 'Decorative Tray'),
