(637, 1, 'GREETING CARD SET - HOLIDAY EDIT RED VINTAGE VINES', '<p>Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and Screen printing.<br />\n<br />\nEach pack contains 8 greeting cards with envelopes.<br />\n<br />\nTime to write a note to someone you care for, a friend, a family member, or even yourself. There’s something intimate and profound about this timeless form of expression.<br />\n<br />\n• Size: 6&quot; x 4&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n• Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'GREETING CARD SET - HOLIDAY EDIT RED VINTAGE VINES', 'Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and Screen printing.\n\nEach pack contains', 'Everyday Greeting Card'),
