(641, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - BLUE CHECKER BOARD - Twin', '<p>Hand-block printed and meticulously crafted using the traditional Indian embroidery technique of &#039;Kantha&#039;, reversible quilt made by local women of Jaipur at Craft Boat studio. This 100% cotton quilt comes from an art form honed for generations and handmade with immense care and precision.<br />\n<br />\n• Twin - 55&quot; x 78&quot;<br />\n• Queen - 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\n• King - 110&quot; x 112&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: Top Fabric - 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nInside Filling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Dry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - BLUE CHECKER BOARD - Twin', 'Hand-block printed and meticulously crafted using the traditional Indian embroidery technique of \'Kantha\', reversible quilt made by local women of Jaipur at Craft Boat studio. This 100% cotton quilt comes from an art form honed for generations and handmad', 'Quilt'),
