(643, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - BLUE CHECKER BOARD - King', '<p>Hand-block printed and meticulously crafted using the traditional Indian embroidery technique of &#039;Kantha&#039;, reversible quilt made by local women of Jaipur at Craft Boat studio. This 100% cotton quilt comes from an art form honed for generations and handmade with immense care and precision.<br />\n<br />\n• Twin - 55&quot; x 78&quot;<br />\n• Queen - 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\n• King - 110&quot; x 112&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: Top Fabric - 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nInside Filling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Dry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - BLUE CHECKER BOARD - King', 'Hand-block printed and meticulously crafted using the traditional Indian embroidery technique of \'Kantha\', reversible quilt made by local women of Jaipur at Craft Boat studio. This 100% cotton quilt comes from an art form honed for generations and handmad', 'Quilt'),
(644, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - GREEN CHERRY BLOSSOM', '<p>Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat studio in Jaipur, reflecting artistry, patience, and precision.<br />\n<br />\nMade from soft cotton voile with pure cotton filling, this reversible quilt offers lightweight comfort with intricate hand-stitched detailing on both sides. Subtle variations make every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to add warmth and timeless charm to your space, it celebrates slow, mindful craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nQueen – 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\nTwin and King sizes available upon request<br />\n<br />\nMaterial:<br />\nTop Fabric: 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nFilling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions:<br />\nDry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - GREEN CHERRY BLOSSOM', 'Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat st', 'Quilt'),
(645, 1, 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - ORANGE BOLD GRID', '<p>Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat studio in Jaipur, reflecting artistry, patience, and precision.<br />\n<br />\nMade from soft cotton voile with pure cotton filling, this reversible quilt offers lightweight comfort with intricate hand-stitched detailing on both sides. Subtle variations make every piece truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to add warmth and timeless charm to your space, it celebrates slow, mindful craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nQueen – 90&quot; x 108&quot;<br />\nTwin and King sizes available upon request<br />\n<br />\nMaterial:<br />\nTop Fabric: 100% Soft Cotton Voile<br />\nFilling: 100% Soft Cotton<br />\n<br />\nCare Instructions:<br />\nDry clean only<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND BLOCK PRINTED QUILT - ORANGE BOLD GRID', 'Rooted in the rich heritage of Indian craftsmanship, this hand block printed quilt is adorned with traditional Kantha embroidery—an age-old technique passed down through generations. Each piece is handcrafted by skilled women artisans at the Craft Boat st', 'Quilt'),
