(660, 1, 'HAND EMBROIDERED CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS - STAR', '<p>Bring festive charm to your holiday décor with our beautifully handcrafted Christmas Ornament Set. <br />\n<br />\nMade from 100% Casement fabric and detailed with intricate embroidery and beadwork, each ornament is designed to add warmth and character to your Christmas tree, wreaths, garlands, or gift wrapping.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 4&quot; x 3.75&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Casement<br />\n<br />\nTechnique: Hand Embroidered with Beadwork<br />\n<br />\nHanging Loop Included<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND EMBROIDERED CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS - STAR', 'Bring festive charm to your holiday décor with our beautifully handcrafted Christmas Ornament Set. \n\nMade from 100% Casement fabric and detailed with intricate embroidery and beadwork, each ornament is designed to add warmth and character to your Christma', 'Ornament'),
(661, 1, 'HAND EMBROIDERED CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS - WRAPPED CANDY', '<p>Bring festive charm to your holiday décor with our beautifully handcrafted Christmas Ornament Set. <br />\n<br />\nMade from 100% Casement fabric and detailed with intricate embroidery and beadwork, each ornament is designed to add warmth and character to your Christmas tree, wreaths, garlands, or gift wrapping.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 3.25&quot; x 2&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Casement<br />\n<br />\nTechnique: Hand Embroidered with Beadwork<br />\n<br />\nHanging Loop Included<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND EMBROIDERED CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS - WRAPPED CANDY', 'Bring festive charm to your holiday décor with our beautifully handcrafted Christmas Ornament Set. \n\nMade from 100% Casement fabric and detailed with intricate embroidery and beadwork, each ornament is designed to add warmth and character to your Christma', 'Ornament'),
(662, 1, 'HAND MARBL ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - GARNET RED PEBBLE', '<p>Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty of slow craftsmanship and intricate detailing.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to be both functional and decorative, its classic appeal makes it a perfect accent for your dressing table, bedside, or vanity corner.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect For: Storing your treasured jewellery, keepsakes, and everyday accessories with care and style.<br />\n<br />\nA delicate blend of artistry and utility, this keepsake box brings elegance to your everyday organization.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot; x 5.25&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBL ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - GARNET RED PEBBLE', 'Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(663, 1, 'HAND MARBL ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - HARBOR BLUE PEBBLE', '<p>Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty of slow craftsmanship and intricate detailing.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to be both functional and decorative, its classic appeal makes it a perfect accent for your dressing table, bedside, or vanity corner.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect For: Storing your treasured jewellery, keepsakes, and everyday accessories with care and style.<br />\n<br />\nA delicate blend of artistry and utility, this keepsake box brings elegance to your everyday organization.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot; x 5.25&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBL ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - HARBOR BLUE PEBBLE', 'Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(664, 1, 'HAND MARBLED RECTANGULAR TISSUE BOX - GREEN FIRE WHIRL', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nThe surface showcases distinctive hand-marbled designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot;W x 8.5&quot;L x 2.75&quot;H<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED RECTANGULAR TISSUE BOX - GREEN FIRE WHIRL', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n', 'Tissue Box'),
(665, 1, 'HAND MARBLED RECTANGULAR TISSUE BOX - RED FIRE WHIRL', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nThe surface showcases distinctive hand-marbled designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot;W x 8.5&quot;L x 2.75&quot;H<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED RECTANGULAR TISSUE BOX - RED FIRE WHIRL', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n', 'Tissue Box'),
