(682, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COLLAPSIBLE BOX- BURGUNDY GOLDEN PEBBLE', '<p>Designed to fold and adapt to your space, this collapsible paper box is perfect for storing small essentials like stationery, jewellery, keepsakes, or everyday accessories. Lightweight yet sturdy, it opens for use and folds flat when not needed—making it both practical and space-saving.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper by skilled artisans in Jaipur, each box features hand marbled designs created in small batches, ensuring every piece is unique.<br />\n<br />\nThoughtfully made for homes inspired by artisanal, slow living.<br />\n<br />\nSize :  9&quot; X 6&quot; X 3&#039;&#039; (Large)<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COLLAPSIBLE BOX- BURGUNDY GOLDEN PEBBLE', 'Designed to fold and adapt to your space, this collapsible paper box is perfect for storing small essentials like stationery, jewellery, keepsakes, or everyday accessories. Lightweight yet sturdy, it opens for use and folds flat when not needed—making it ', 'Decorative Box'),
(683, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COTTEN RUFFLED CUSHION COVER -TWILIGHT MOUNTAIN', '<p>Inspired by the charm of artisanal living, this hand-marbled cushion cover brings a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring intricate marbled patterns, each piece is one of a kind—celebrating the fluid beauty and uniqueness of traditional handcraft techniques.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with delicate ruffled edges, it adds texture and a subtle vintage appeal—perfect for styling sofas, beds, or accent chairs. Made from Cotton and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans, each cover carries its own distinct character.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 12&quot; x 16&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\nClosure: Concealed zipper for a neat, seamless finish<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle with like colors. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry on a low setting. Iron on the reverse side suggested.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COTTEN RUFFLED CUSHION COVER -TWILIGHT MOUNTAIN', 'Inspired by the charm of artisanal living, this hand-marbled cushion cover brings a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring intricate marbled patterns, each piece is one of a kind—celebrating the fluid beauty and uniqueness of traditional handcraft t', 'Pillow/Cushion - Kids & Baby'),
(684, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - GARNET RED FIRE WHIRL', '<p>A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with an easy drawstring closure, it&#039;s ideal for storing rings, earrings, bracelets, and small keepsakes. Lightweight and travel-friendly, it slips easily into your handbag or luggage.<br />\n<br />\nHand-marbled and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans in Jaipur, India, each pouch celebrates the beauty of traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 6&quot; × 4.5&quot; × 4.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - GARNET RED FIRE WHIRL', 'A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.\n\nFinished with an easy draw', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(685, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - HARBOR BLUE FIRE WHIRL', '<p>A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with an easy drawstring closure, it&#039;s ideal for storing rings, earrings, bracelets, and small keepsakes. Lightweight and travel-friendly, it slips easily into your handbag or luggage.<br />\n<br />\nHand-marbled and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans in Jaipur, India, each pouch celebrates the beauty of traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 6&quot; × 4.5&quot; × 4.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COTTON JEWELLERY POUCH - HARBOR BLUE FIRE WHIRL', 'A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.\n\nFinished with an easy draw', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(686, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COTTON RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - BLUE BANYAN', '<p>Inspired by the charm of artisanal living, this hand-marbled cushion cover brings a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring intricate marbled patterns, each piece is one of a kind—celebrating the fluid beauty and uniqueness of traditional handcraft techniques.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with delicate ruffled edges, it adds texture and a subtle vintage appeal—perfect for styling sofas, beds, or accent chairs. Made from premium European linen and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans, each cover carries its own distinct character.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\nSize: 12&quot; x 16&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\nClosure: Concealed zipper for a neat, seamless finish<br />\n<br />\nCare Instruction: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle with like colors. Lay flat to dry or tumble dry on a low setting. Iron on the reverse side suggested.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COTTON RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - BLUE BANYAN', 'Inspired by the charm of artisanal living, this hand-marbled cushion cover brings a soft, elegant touch to your space. Featuring intricate marbled patterns, each piece is one of a kind—celebrating the fluid beauty and uniqueness of traditional handcraft t', 'Throw Pillow Cover'),
(687, 1, 'HAND MARBLED COTTON RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - GREEN BANYAN', '<p>Inspired by the beauty of handcrafted design, this ruffled cushion cover features unique hand marbled patterns, making every piece one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nMade from 100% Cotton, it is finished with soft ruffled edges and a concealed zipper, adding a cozy, timeless touch to sofas, beds, and accent chairs. Handmade in small batches, each piece celebrates traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 12&quot; × 16&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\nTechnique: Hand Marbled<br />\nClosure: Concealed zipper for a neat, seamless finish<br />\n<br />\nCare: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle. Lay flat or tumble dry on low. Iron on the reverse if needed.<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED COTTON RUFFLED CUSHION COVER - GREEN BANYAN', 'Inspired by the beauty of handcrafted design, this ruffled cushion cover features unique hand marbled patterns, making every piece one of a kind.\n\nMade from 100% Cotton, it is finished with soft ruffled edges and a concealed zipper, adding a cozy, timeles', 'Throw Pillow Cover');
