(713, 1, 'HAND MARBLED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - BLUE PEACOCK FEATHER - Large', '<p>100% Recycled Cotton Paper, Hand Marbled Cover.<br />\n<br />\nContains 56 unruled, plain edge pages.<br />\n<br />\nHard Cover and exposed binding.<br />\n<br />\nSizes:<br />\n• Small - 5&quot; x 7&quot;<br />\n• Large - 6&quot; x 8&quot;</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - BLUE PEACOCK FEATHER - Large', '100% Recycled Cotton Paper, Hand Marbled Cover.\n\nContains 56 unruled, plain edge pages.\n\nHard Cover and exposed binding.\n\nSizes:\n• Small - 5\" x 7\"\n• Large - 6\" x 8\"', 'Journal/Diary'),
(714, 1, 'HAND MARBLED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - BLUE PEACOCK FEATHER - Small', '<p>100% Recycled Cotton Paper, Hand Marbled Cover.<br />\n<br />\nContains 56 unruled, plain edge pages.<br />\n<br />\nHard Cover and exposed binding.<br />\n<br />\nSizes:<br />\n• Small - 5&quot; x 7&quot;<br />\n• Large - 6&quot; x 8&quot;</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED EXPOSED BINDING JOURNAL - BLUE PEACOCK FEATHER - Small', '100% Recycled Cotton Paper, Hand Marbled Cover.\n\nContains 56 unruled, plain edge pages.\n\nHard Cover and exposed binding.\n\nSizes:\n• Small - 5\" x 7\"\n• Large - 6\" x 8\"', 'Journal/Diary'),
(715, 1, 'HAND MARBLED FABRIC PLEATED LAMPSHADE - MOSS PEBBLE', '<p>Hand-marbled fabric pleated lampshades with a spider fitting blend artisanal craftsmanship with functional elegance. Each shade features a unique print, meticulously crafted by hand, making it a one-of-a-kind lighting accessory.<br />\n<br />\nThese lampshades are hand-marbled by master artisans in Jaipur and produced in small batches. Designed to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow-living objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 6.25” H x 9” W x 4.25” Ø<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% cotton</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED FABRIC PLEATED LAMPSHADE - MOSS PEBBLE', 'Hand-marbled fabric pleated lampshades with a spider fitting blend artisanal craftsmanship with functional elegance. Each shade features a unique print, meticulously crafted by hand, making it a one-of-a-kind lighting accessory.\n\nThese lampshades are hand', 'Lamp Shade'),
(716, 1, 'HAND MARBLED GREETING CARD SET - BLUE BANYAN', '<p>Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and hand marbling.<br />\n<br />\nEach pack contains 8 greeting cards with envelopes.<br />\n<br />\nTime to write a note to someone you care for, a friend, a family member, or even yourself. There’s something intimate and profound about this timeless form of expression.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 6&quot; x 4&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED GREETING CARD SET - BLUE BANYAN', 'Collectible Greeting Card Set: a series of simple yet thoughtfully crafted cards made from 100% recycled cotton and handmade paper, produced in small batches by master artisans who practice the craft of papermaking and hand marbling.\n\nEach pack contains 8', 'Everyday Greeting Card'),
