(766, 1, 'HAND MARBLED JEWELLERY POUCH - CELADON GREEN FIRE WHIRL', '<p>A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.<br />\n<br />\nFinished with an easy drawstring closure, it&#039;s ideal for storing rings, earrings, bracelets, and small keepsakes. Lightweight and travel-friendly, it slips easily into your handbag or luggage.<br />\n<br />\nHand marbled and handcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans in Jaipur, India, each pouch celebrates the beauty of traditional craftsmanship.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\n• Size: 6&quot; × 4.5&quot; × 4.5&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED JEWELLERY POUCH - CELADON GREEN FIRE WHIRL', 'A compact quilted jewellery pouch designed to keep your valuables safe, organized, and protected. Crafted from 100% cotton and individually hand marbled, each piece features unique flowing patterns, making no two exactly alike.\n\nFinished with an easy draw', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
