(779, 1, 'HAND MARBLED LARGE PLAIN LAMPSHADE - BLUE GOLD PEBBLE', '<p>Hand-marbled lampshades with a spider fitting blend artisanal craftsmanship with functional elegance. Each shade features a unique marbled pattern, meticulously crafted by hand, making it a one-of-a-kind lighting accessory.<br />\n<br />\nThis product is made with 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, hand marbled by Master Artisans in Jaipur.<br />\n<br />\nProduced in small batches only. Designed to inspire a home filled with Artisanal Slow Living Objects.<br />\n<br />\n• Size: 9.5&quot;Ø x 14&quot;W x 10.5&quot;H<br />\n• Material: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED LARGE PLAIN LAMPSHADE - BLUE GOLD PEBBLE', 'Hand-marbled lampshades with a spider fitting blend artisanal craftsmanship with functional elegance. Each shade features a unique marbled pattern, meticulously crafted by hand, making it a one-of-a-kind lighting accessory.\n\nThis product is made with 100%', 'Lamp Shade');
