(809, 1, 'HAND MARBLED PIPED SQUARE CUSHION COVER - GREEN MOUNTAIN', '<p>Elevate your living space with this beautifully crafted hand-marbled cushion cover, designed to bring effortless elegance and artistic charm into your home. Each piece features a one-of-a-kind pattern, inspired by the fluid movement of colors, making every cushion truly unique.<br />\n<br />\nHandcrafted in small batches by skilled artisans, it seamlessly blends contemporary design with timeless craftsmanship—perfect for styling your sofa, bed, or favorite cozy corner.<br />\n<br />\nDetails:<br />\n• Size: 18&quot; x 18&quot;<br />\n• Material: 100% Cotton<br />\n• Closure: Concealed YKK zipper for a clean, refined finish<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED PIPED SQUARE CUSHION COVER - GREEN MOUNTAIN', 'Elevate your living space with this beautifully crafted hand-marbled cushion cover, designed to bring effortless elegance and artistic charm into your home. Each piece features a one-of-a-kind pattern, inspired by the fluid movement of colors, making ever', 'Throw Pillow Cover'),
(810, 1, 'HAND MARBLED POLDINA LAMPSHADE COVER - RED PEBBLE', '<p>Hand Marbled Lampshade Covers, designed to fit the Poldina Pro LED Table Lamp. A simple way to add handcrafted beauty to everyday functional products. <br />\n<br />\nMade from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, these covers are hand-marbled by Master Artisans in Jaipur and produced in small batches. Designed to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow-living objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 3.75&quot;H x 4.5&quot;W x 3.5&quot;Ø<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED POLDINA LAMPSHADE COVER - RED PEBBLE', 'Hand Marbled Lampshade Covers, designed to fit the Poldina Pro LED Table Lamp. A simple way to add handcrafted beauty to everyday functional products. \n\nMade from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, these covers are hand-marbled by Master Artisans in Jai', 'Lamp Shade'),
