(825, 1, 'HAND MARBLED QUILTED POUCH - GARNET RED PEBBLE - Large', '<p>Designed to keep your essentials organized, this pouch is perfect for storing toiletries, makeup, and accessories—at home or on the go. Available in two sizes for everyday convenience.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted from 100% cotton, each piece is hand marbled and quilted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. Made in small batches, it reflects careful craftsmanship and a timeless, artisanal aesthetic.<br />\n<br />\nA practical yet beautiful essential, designed to inspire a lifestyle rooted in slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nSize:<br />\nLarge – 9.5&quot; x 6.5&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\nSmall – 7.5&quot; x 4.5&quot; x 2&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED QUILTED POUCH - GARNET RED PEBBLE - Large', 'Designed to keep your essentials organized, this pouch is perfect for storing toiletries, makeup, and accessories—at home or on the go. Available in two sizes for everyday convenience.\n\nCrafted from 100% cotton, each piece is hand marbled and quilted by m', 'Pouch - Women\'s');
