(859, 1, 'HAND MARBLED ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - GREEN PEBBLE', '<p>Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty of slow craftsmanship and intricate detailing.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to be both functional and decorative, its classic appeal makes it a perfect accent for your dressing table, bedside, or vanity corner.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect For: Storing your treasured jewellery, keepsakes, and everyday accessories with care and style.<br />\n<br />\nA delicate blend of artistry and utility, this keepsake box brings elegance to your everyday organization. <br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot; x 5.25&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED ROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX - GREEN PEBBLE', 'Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty', 'Desk Organizer'),
