(889, 1, 'HAND MARBLED SCALLOPED PICTURE FRAME - CELADON GREEN BANYAN', '<p>A simple and thoughtful frame for displaying your favorite memories. Designed for the wall, its elegant scalloped silhouette and hand-marbled finish bring warmth, artistry, and timeless charm to any space.<br />\n<br />\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Scalloped Wall Frames are crafted by master artisans who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations. Each frame is individually hand marbled, creating unique, organic patterns. Made in small batches, subtle variations celebrate the beauty of handcrafted artistry.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow living objects, this frame blends timeless craftsmanship with everyday functionality.<br />\n<br />\nSize: Frame Size – 10&quot; × 12&quot; / Photo Size – 5&quot; × 7&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Fabric<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLED SCALLOPED PICTURE FRAME - CELADON GREEN BANYAN', 'A simple and thoughtful frame for displaying your favorite memories. Designed for the wall, its elegant scalloped silhouette and hand-marbled finish bring warmth, artistry, and timeless charm to any space.\n\nRecycled Cotton Handmade Scalloped Wall Frames a', 'Picture Frame'),
