(1003, 1, 'HAND MARBLROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX- CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', '<p>Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty of slow craftsmanship and intricate detailing.<br />\n<br />\nDesigned to be both functional and decorative, its classic appeal makes it a perfect accent for your dressing table, bedside, or vanity corner.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect For: Storing your treasured jewellery, keepsakes, and everyday accessories with care and style.<br />\n<br />\nA delicate blend of artistry and utility, this keepsake box brings elegance to your everyday organization.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.25&quot; x 5.25&quot; x 3&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% cotton</p>', 'ready', 'HAND MARBLROUND KEEPSAKE JEWELLERY BOX- CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', 'Add a touch of timeless charm to your space with this exquisite jewellery box, beautifully crafted using hand-marbled cotton fabric laid over a sturdy hardboard base. Thoughtfully created by skilled artisans of Craft Boat, each piece celebrates the beauty', 'Jewelry Box/Organizer'),
(1004, 1, 'HAND PRINTED SQUARE TISSUE BOX - CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', '<p>Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.<br />\n<br />\nThe surface showcases distinctive hand-printed designs, created in small batches—making every box truly one of a kind. Both functional and decorative, these tissue boxes add a touch of artisanal elegance to any space while embracing the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nPerfect for elevating everyday essentials, they seamlessly blend sustainability with timeless design.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5&quot; x 5&quot; x 5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Handmade Paper<br />\n<br />\nOrigin: Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND PRINTED SQUARE TISSUE BOX - CELADON GREEN PEBBLE', 'Recycled cotton handmade paper tissue boxes, thoughtfully crafted by master artisans in India. With generations of expertise in vintage-style boxes and traditional cartonnage techniques, each piece reflects exceptional craftsmanship and heritage.\n\nThe sur', 'Tissue Box'),
