(1019, 1, 'HAND PRINTED HEXAGON COLLAPSIBLE BASKET- GARNET RED PEBBLE', '<p>Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any space.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted from 100% recycled cotton handmade paper, each basket features beautiful hand-printed designs inspired by traditional craftsmanship. Handmade in small batches by skilled artisans, every piece is unique, celebrating sustainable materials and the beauty of slow, mindful living.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 9.5&quot; × 9.5&quot; × 10.5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Handmade Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HAND PRINTED HEXAGON COLLAPSIBLE BASKET- GARNET RED PEBBLE', 'Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any sp', 'Basket'),
