(1022, 1, 'HANDBLOCK PRINTED BEAUTY BAG (M) - GREEN SPRING BLOOM', '<p>Designed to keep your essentials organized, this beauty bag is perfect for storing toiletries, makeup, and accessories—at home or on the go. Compact yet spacious, it’s ideal for everyday use and travel.<br />\n<br />\nCrafted from 100% cotton, each piece is carefully block printed and quilted by master artisans in Jaipur, India. Made in small batches, the bag reflects thoughtful craftsmanship and a refined, artisanal aesthetic.<br />\n<br />\nA functional essential that brings together practicality and the charm of slow living.<br />\n<br />\nSize: Medium – 8.5&quot; x 4&quot; x 3.5&quot;<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'HANDBLOCK PRINTED BEAUTY BAG (M) - GREEN SPRING BLOOM', 'Designed to keep your essentials organized, this beauty bag is perfect for storing toiletries, makeup, and accessories—at home or on the go. Compact yet spacious, it’s ideal for everyday use and travel.\n\nCrafted from 100% cotton, each piece is carefully b', 'Pouch - Unisex'),
