(1049, 1, 'HANDMADE PAPER ALPHABET NOTEBOOK - ASSORTED SET OF 32', '<p>A giftable assortment of pocket notebooks featuring hand-marbled covers and hand-painted alphabet initials.<br />\n<br />\nEach notebook is handcrafted using 100% recycled cotton handmade paper. As every sheet is individually marbled by hand, each cover has its own unique pattern and character.<br />\nEach wholesale case includes 32 notebooks, with two notebooks each of 16 selected alphabet letters. The assortment is ideal for gift shops, stationery stores, museum shops and lifestyle boutiques.<br />\n<br />\nPlease note: Cover colours and marbled patterns are supplied as a random assortment. The patterns received may differ from those shown in the listing images, and a particular pattern cannot be selected for a specific alphabet. These natural variations make every notebook one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nProduct Details<br />\n<br />\nSize: 5.5&quot; × 3.75&quot;<br />\nPages: 20 pages<br />\nPaper: 100% recycled cotton<br />\nCase Pack: 32 notebooks<br />\nAssortment: 16 alphabet letters × 2 notebooks each<br />\nLetters Included: A, B, C, D, E, G, H, J, K, L, M, N, P, R, S and T<br />\nCover Assortment: Random mix of hand-marbled colours and patterns<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nLooking for Additional Alphabets? Please write to us if you would like to order an alphabet that is not included in the standard assortment. We will be happy to check availability and custom order options.</p>', 'ready', 'HANDMADE PAPER ALPHABET NOTEBOOK - ASSORTED SET OF 32', 'A giftable assortment of pocket notebooks featuring hand-marbled covers and hand-painted alphabet initials.\n\nEach notebook is handcrafted using 100% recycled cotton handmade paper. As every sheet is individually marbled by hand, each cover has its own uni', 'Notebook'),
(1050, 1, 'HANDMADE PAPER FLOWER - BLUE HYDRANGEA', '<p>This Artisanal, of a kind, Paper Flower sticks are beautifully handcrafted by women artisans of Craft Boat. All the paper used is 100% recycled from cotton textile waste. Produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home filled with Nostalgic &amp; Slow Living Objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 2.5&quot; x 9&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper <br />\n<br />\n Made in India</p>', 'ready', 'HANDMADE PAPER FLOWER - BLUE HYDRANGEA', 'This Artisanal, of a kind, Paper Flower sticks are beautifully handcrafted by women artisans of Craft Boat. All the paper used is 100% recycled from cotton textile waste. Produced in Small Batches only. Designed to Inspire a home filled with Nostalgic & S', 'Artificial Flowers'),
