(1081, 1, 'MARBLED HEXAGON COLLAPSIBLE BASKET - BLUE OCHRE MOUNTAIN', '<p>Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any space.<br />\n<br />\nThese recycled cotton, handmade paper baskets are crafted by master artisans in Jaipur, who have been creating vintage-style boxes and cartonnage products for generations. The paper design features unique Hand Marbled and is produced in small batches. celebrating the beauty of mindful, slow living.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 9.5&quot; x 9.5&quot; x 10.5&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Recycled Cotton Paper<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'MARBLED HEXAGON COLLAPSIBLE BASKET - BLUE OCHRE MOUNTAIN', 'Designed to elevate the quiet corners of your home, this versatile paper basket blends functionality with artisanal charm. Ideal for dry waste or for storing rolls of paper, fabric, toys, or everyday essentials, it brings effortless organization to any sp', 'Basket'),
