(1149, 1, 'NATURAL DYED COTTON RIBBONS - CEDAR GREY (Pack of 6)', '<p>Set of 6 Cedar Grey Dyed Ribbons<br />\n<br />\nAdd a calm, understated touch to your gifts and spaces with our cedar grey-dyed ribbons. Crafted from 100% cotton and naturally dyed in cedar grey tones, each ribbon carries a soft, muted hue that feels both elegant and grounding.<br />\n<br />\nPacked as a set of six, these ribbons are perfect for gift wrapping, decorating, or adding a thoughtful detail to special occasions.<br />\n<br />\nHandmade with care by the artisans of Craft Boat.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 200 cm x 3 cm<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton, Naturally Dyed<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'NATURAL DYED COTTON RIBBONS - CEDAR GREY (Pack of 6)', 'Set of 6 Cedar Grey Dyed Ribbons\n\nAdd a calm, understated touch to your gifts and spaces with our cedar grey-dyed ribbons. Crafted from 100% cotton and naturally dyed in cedar grey tones, each ribbon carries a soft, muted hue that feels both elegant and g', 'Ribbon - Gift Wrapping'),
