(1180, 1, 'SCALLOPED FABRIC PLEATED LAMPSHADE - BRICK RED SHADOW STRIPE', '<p>Hand-block-printed fabric pleated lampshades with a UNO fitting combine artisanal craftsmanship and functional elegance. Each shade showcases a distinctive hand-block-printed pattern, carefully pleated and finished to create a timeless lighting accent. Crafted individually, each piece features subtle variations that make it truly one of a kind.<br />\n<br />\nThis lampshade is made from 100% cotton and hand-block-printed by master artisans in Jaipur.<br />\n<br />\nProduced in small batches only, it is designed to inspire a home filled with artisanal, slow-living objects.<br />\n<br />\nSize: 4.25&quot; x 9&quot; x 6.25&quot;<br />\n<br />\nMaterial: 100% Cotton<br />\n<br />\nMade in India</p>', 'ready', 'SCALLOPED FABRIC PLEATED LAMPSHADE - BRICK RED SHADOW STRIPE', 'Hand-block-printed fabric pleated lampshades with a UNO fitting combine artisanal craftsmanship and functional elegance. Each shade showcases a distinctive hand-block-printed pattern, carefully pleated and finished to create a timeless lighting accent. Cr', 'Lamp Shade'),
