(1209, 1, 'Vintage Candle Glass Stand - Red', '<p>Elevate your ambiance with the beauty of our borosilicate candle stand. The durable &amp; heat resistance glass ensures stability &amp; allows essence of candle light all over. <br />\n<br />\nDimensions - 11.5&quot; (H) x 3&quot; (bottom ∅) 2.2&quot;(top ∅)&#039;&#039;</p>', 'ready', 'Vintage Candle Glass Stand - Red', 'Elevate your ambiance with the beauty of our borosilicate candle stand. The durable & heat resistance glass ensures stability & allows essence of candle light all over. \n\nDimensions - 11.5\" (H) x 3\" (bottom ∅) 2.2\"(top ∅)\'\'', 'Candle Holder'),
